config AK_GMAC
	tristate "Anyka EV300/EV330 Synopsys GMAC Ethernet"
	depends on ARCH_AK && OF
	select CRC32
	help
	  The Synopsys GMAC in the AK3918EV300 and AK39EV330 parts
	  (anyka,ak39ev330-ethernet), from the Cloud39EV300 SDK's driver.
	  The MAC interface comes from the device tree's phy-mode, RMII
	  unless "mii" is given.

	  The EV200's older MAC is AK_ETHERNET instead.
